<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santander-Chile cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santander-Chile cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming analyst Jorge Scarinci has reduced his rating for Banco Santander-Chile to long-term buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Even though we maintain our positive view on the bank, the completion of the merger process (with Banco Osorno) will take longer than expected -- turning BSC into a 1998 story,&quot; he wrote in an April 24 report.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were up 1/8 to 15-3/4 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
